        {
          "text": "Ate Balukanani mutabani wa Akubooli bwe yafa, Kadali n'afuga mu kifo kye, ng'ali mu kibuga kye Pawu; mukazi we yayitibwanga Meketaberu muwala wa Mezakabu ne Matirida.",
